{"page":353,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:28","surah":24,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن لَّمْ تَجِدُوا۟ فِيهَآ أَحَدًا فَلَا تَدْخُلُوهَا حَتَّىٰ يُؤْذَنَ لَكُمْ ۖ وَإِن قِيلَ لَكُمُ ٱرْجِعُوا۟ فَٱرْجِعُوا۟ ۖ هُوَ أَزْكَىٰ لَكُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you find no one in, do not enter unless you have been given permission to do so. If you are told, ‘Go away’, then do so- that is more proper for you. God knows well what you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you find","transliteration":"tajidū","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadan","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَدْخُلُوهَا","en_gloss":"enter it","transliteration":"tadkhulūhā","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُؤْذَنَ","en_gloss":"permission has been given","transliteration":"yu'dhana","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱرْجِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go back","transliteration":"ir'jiʿū","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَٱرْجِعُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"then go back","transliteration":"fa-ir'jiʿū","verse_key":"24:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"24:28"},{