4:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَزْكَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) purer","transliteration":"azkā","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَبِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīrun","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَصْنَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yaṣnaʿūna","verse_key":"24:30"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:30"}]},{"verse_key":"24:31","surah":24,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَقُل لِّلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ يَغْضُضْنَ مِنْ أَبْصَـٰرِهِنَّ وَيَحْفَظْنَ فُرُوجَهُنَّ وَلَا يُبْدِينَ زِينَتَهُنَّ إِلَّا مَا ظَهَرَ مِنْهَا ۖ وَلْيَضْرِبْنَ بِخُمُرِهِنَّ عَلَىٰ جُيُوبِهِنَّ ۖ وَلَا يُبْدِينَ زِينَتَهُنَّ إِلَّا لِبُعُولَتِهِنَّ أَوْ ءَابَآئِهِنَّ أَوْ ءَابَآءِ بُعُولَتِهِنَّ أَوْ أَبْنَآئِهِنَّ أَوْ أَبْنَآءِ بُعُولَتِهِنَّ أَوْ إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ أَوْ بَنِىٓ إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ أَوْ بَنِىٓ أَخَوَٰتِهِنَّ أَوْ نِسَآئِهِنَّ أَوْ مَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُهُنَّ أَوِ ٱلتَّـٰبِعِينَ غَيْرِ أُو۟لِى ٱلْإِرْبَةِ مِنَ ٱلرِّجَالِ أَوِ ٱلطِّفْلِ ٱلَّذِينَ لَمْ يَظْهَرُوا۟ عَلَىٰ عَوْرَٰتِ ٱلنِّسَآءِ ۖ وَلَا يَضْرِبْنَ بِأَرْجُلِهِنَّ لِيُعْلَمَ مَا يُخْفِينَ مِن زِينَتِهِنَّ ۚ وَتُوبُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ جَمِيعًا أَيُّهَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And tell believing women that they should lower their glances, guard their private parts, and not display their charms beyond what [it is acceptable] to reveal; they should let their headscarves fall to cover their necklines and not reveal their charms except to their husbands, their fathers, their husbands’ fathers, their sons, their husbands’ sons, their brothers, their brothers’ sons, their sisters’ sons, their womenfolk, their slaves, such men as attend them who have no sexual desire, or children who are not yet aware of women’s nakedness; they should not stamp their feet so as to draw attention to any hidden charms. Believers, all of you, turn to God so that you may prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقُل","en_gloss":"And say","transliteration":"waqul","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِّلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"to the believing women","transliteration":"lil'mu'mināti","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَغْضُضْنَ","en_gloss":"(that) they should lower","transliteration":"yaghḍuḍ'na","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَبْصَـٰرِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their gaze","transliteration":"abṣārihinna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَحْفَظْنَ","en_gloss":"and they should guard","transliteration":"wayaḥfaẓna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فُرُوجَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their chastity","transliteration":"furūjahunna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُبْدِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) display","transliteration":"yub'dīna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"زِينَتَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their adornment","transliteration":"zīnatahunna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ظَهَرَ","en_gloss":"is apparent","transliteration":"ẓahara","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلْيَضْرِبْنَ","en_gloss":"And let them draw","transliteration":"walyaḍrib'na","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِخُمُرِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their head covers","transliteration":"bikhumurihinna","verse_key":"24:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over